WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.283
Download the installer for Mac, Windows or Linux from the releases page.

2
00:00:06.383 --> 00:00:10.752
On a Mac, drag Lampstand into Applications.

3
00:00:10.852 --> 00:00:18.061
On Windows, choose More info, then Run anyway, because the installer is not signed yet.

4
00:00:18.161 --> 00:00:22.827
Lampstand needs the internet only to download and to update.
